    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLLEGE OF ARMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The College of Arms, the official heraldic authority for England, Wales, and Northern Ireland, provides data supporting the marriage between Ann Pleydell-Bouverie and John Kennett Walker."</data>
